 "script": "Scary mortgage letters? Easy. Out of sight, out of mind.\n\nInto the freezer you go. All of you!\n\nUh oh. Why won't the door close?\n\nGood news. In most cases, your servicer can't start foreclosure until you're more than one hundred twenty days behind.\n\nSo use that time. Here's how.\n\nOne. Open the mail, and call your servicer early.\n\nTwo. Ask about your options: forbearance, a repayment plan, a loan modification, or selling first.\n\nThree. Talk to a free HUD-approved housing counselor before you sign anything.\n\nIf Homie can figure it out, so can you.",
